{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.dq_squared","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.dq_squared","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.dq_squared_at_q_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.dq_squared_at_q_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L56-L64","doc":"**Classical-limit corollary** (`q = 1`): the formula's scalar factor\n`q⁻¹·(1 − q⁻¹)` vanishes, so `d_q²` is the zero operator,\nrecovering classical de Rham `d² = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.dq_squared","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.dq_squared","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L47-L54","doc":"**Archimedean `d_q² α` formula** ([`prop:categorical-dq-squared`]).\n\n`d_q² α = q⁻¹ · (1 − q⁻¹) · (dΘ ∧ 𝓛_ξ α)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:dq-squared","label":"prop:dq-squared","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/dq-squared.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.claim_dq_squared","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.claim_dq_squared","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Manuscript `d_q²` formula: `d_q² α = q⁻¹·(1 − q⁻¹)·(dΘ ∧ 𝓛_ξ α)`\nfor every `k`-form `α`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.q_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.q_pos","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Positivity: `q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.q","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The substrate parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.dTheta_wedge_lieXi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.dTheta_wedge_lieXi","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The wedge product `dΘ ∧ 𝓛_ξ α` packaged as a function of `α`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.d_q_squared","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.d_q_squared","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The `q`-deformed exterior derivative squared `d_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.smul","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Scalar-multiplication on `ΩK`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.ΩK","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.ΩK","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L31-L31","doc":"The `k`-form space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DqSquaredContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DqSquaredContext","kind":"class","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/dq_squared.lean#L28-L45","doc":"Abstract context for the archimedean `d_q² α` formula. ","signatureChunk":0}]}